{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53333","headline":"诗偈 四十四 · 庞藴","name":"诗偈 四十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"但自无心於万物，何妨万物常围遶。\n铁牛不怕师子吼，恰似木人见花鸟。\n木人本体自无情，花鸟逢人亦不惊。\n心境如如只个（《缁门警训》卷九作「遮」）是，何虑菩提道不成。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"庞藴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53333.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53333","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}